 <!-- CARROT:MANUAL:BEGIN TurnSpeedControlMode -->
 <!-- CARROT:REVIEW reviewed-for="" -->
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN BEHAVIOR -->
+### Behavior
+
+Mode 0 disables these curve candidates; mode 1 uses vision; mode 2 uses vision plus matched navigation geometry; mode 3 uses matched geometry only. Fresh position, heading and the near model path must agree before the route contributes.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END BEHAVIOR -->
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN USAGE -->
+### Use
+
+Select mode 2 with an actual coordinate-navigation route or external polyline. Preview uses up to 500 m of available geometry without requiring a TBT instruction. Confirmed easing releases the route ceiling gradually.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END USAGE -->
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN REFERENCE -->
+### Reference
+
+An external session without a polyline cannot borrow a saved Mapbox route. Road, lead and driver policies remain separate. Offline tests do not establish vehicle performance.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END REFERENCE -->
 <!-- CARROT:MANUAL:END TurnSpeedControlMode -->
 
 <!-- CARROT:SETTING:END TurnSpeedControlMode -->
--- a/KO-턴속도제어방법.md
+++ b/KO-턴속도제어방법.md
@@ -28,6 +28,21 @@
 
 <!-- CARROT:MANUAL:BEGIN TurnSpeedControlMode -->
 <!-- CARROT:REVIEW reviewed-for="" -->
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN BEHAVIOR -->
+### 동작
+
+0은 커브 후보를 끄고 1은 비전, 2는 비전과 일치 확인된 내비 경로, 3은 일치 확인된 경로만 사용합니다. 최신 위치·방향과 가까운 모델 경로가 일치해야 경로 후보가 적용됩니다.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END BEHAVIOR -->
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN USAGE -->
+### 사용
+
+좌표 내비 경로 또는 외부 폴리라인과 함께 모드 2를 사용합니다. TBT 없이 최대 500m 전방의 제공된 경로를 계산하며 완화가 확인되면 상한을 점진적으로 회복합니다.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END USAGE -->
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN REFERENCE -->
+### 참고
+
+폴리라인 없는 외부 세션에 저장된 Mapbox 경로를 대신 넣지 않습니다. 다른 속도·차간·운전자 정책은 유지하며 오프라인 검증은 실차 성능 증명이 아닙니다.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END REFERENCE -->
 <!-- CARROT:MANUAL:END TurnSpeedControlMode -->
 
 <!-- CARROT:SETTING:END TurnSpeedControlMode -->
--- a/EN-MapTurnSpeedFactor.md
+++ b/EN-MapTurnSpeedFactor.md
@@ -29,6 +29,21 @@
 
 <!-- CARROT:MANUAL:BEGIN MapTurnSpeedFactor -->
 <!-- CARROT:REVIEW reviewed-for="" -->
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN BEHAVIOR -->
+### Behavior
+
+Lower values reduce the curvature-derived route target; higher values raise it. The factor and curve floor are applied before the distance and response allowance, using the curve sensitivity lateral budget.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END BEHAVIOR -->
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN USAGE -->
+### Use
+
+Adjust only after a route is matched. A no-route or straight-road no-limit result is not scaled into a braking request.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END USAGE -->
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN REFERENCE -->
+### Reference
+
+This changes a speed ceiling, not commanded acceleration. In mode 2 a lower vision curve ceiling still wins.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END REFERENCE -->
 <!-- CARROT:MANUAL:END MapTurnSpeedFactor -->
 
 <!-- CARROT:SETTING:END MapTurnSpeedFactor -->
